<view class="page-container">
  
  <view class="header">
    <text class="title">连接教务系统</text>
    <text class="subtitle">一次绑定，解锁课表、成绩、考场等全部校园专属功能</text>
  </view>

  <view class="form-card">
    <van-field
      value="{{ studentId }}"
      clearable
      label="学号"
      placeholder="请输入教务系统学号"
      bind:change="onIdChange"
      size="large"
    />

    <van-field
      value="{{ password }}"
      type="password"
      label="密码"
      placeholder="请输入教务系统密码"
      border="{{ false }}"
      bind:change="onPwdChange"
      size="large"
    />
  </view>

  <view class="btn-wrap">
    <van-button 
      type="info" 
      block 
      round 
      size="large" 
      color="linear-gradient(135deg, #4A90E2 0%, #50E3C2 100%)"
      loading="{{ isSubmitting }}" 
      loading-text="正在验证身份..."
      bind:click="onSubmit"
    >
      授权并绑定
    </van-button>
  </view>

  <view class="privacy-tip">
    <text class="tip-icon">🛡️</text>
    <text>安全承诺：您的账号信息仅加密存储于手机本地，仅用于向教务系统请求数据，我们绝不上传至任何第三方云端。</text>
  </view>

  <van-toast id="van-toast" />

</view>